The agent receives these results and uses them to construct its response.

Step 4 — Give the agent another tool: Get Document Details
You can create another tool:

get_document_details

Parameters:
- Document ID.
- Section name.
Its responsibility is to retrieve the full section when the search tool only returns a small excerpt.

This gives you a useful combination:
- Search tool: finds relevant information.
- Details tool: retrieves additional context.
You don't need 20 tools. Start with these two.

